#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.5.rst:17
msgid ""
"**URL Helper:** The bug where the regular expression in "
":php:func:`auto_link()` was old has been fixed. As a result of this fix, "
"the same regular expression as CodeIgniter 3 is now used."
msgstr ""
"**URL 헬퍼:** :php:func:`auto_link()`\ 의 정규 표현식이 구버전이었던 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"이 수정으로 인해 이제 CodeIgniter 3과 동일한 정규 표현식이 사용됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.5.rst:21
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
